 ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">每当感谢之花绽放之时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a ri ga to u no ha na sa ku ta bi</span></p><p begin="15.138" end="19.221" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.138" end="16.228">輝</span><span begin="16.228" end="16.600">い</span><span begin="16.600" end="16.925">て</span><span begin="16.925" end="17.259">ゆ</span><span begin="17.259" end="17.410">く</span><span begin="17.410" end="19.221">物語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们的故事便愈发熠熠生辉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ka ga ya i te yu ku su to-ri</span></p><p begin="19.360" end="23.333" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.360" end="20.304">胸</span><span begin="20.304" end="20.484">に</span><span begin="20.484" end="20.669">抱</span><span begin="20.669" end="20.840">い</span><span begin="20.840" end="21.570">て</span><span begin="21.570" end="22.475">歩</span><span begin="22.475" end="22.642">い</span><span begin="22.642" end="22.825">て</span><span begin="22.825" end="23.009">ゆ</span><span begin="23.009" end="23.163">こ</span><span begin="23.163" end="23.333">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">心怀着它 向前迈进</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mu ne ni da i te a ru i te yu ko u</span></p><p begin="23.527" end="26.881" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.527" end="23.694">素</span><span begin="23.694" end="23.879">晴</span><span begin="23.879" end="24.052">ら</span><span begin="24.052" end="24.231">し</span><span begin="24.231" end="26.881">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">引人入胜般的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">su ba ra shi i</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="24.788" end="26.908"><span begin="24.788" end="25.899">(今日</span> <span begin="25.899" end="26.227">ほ</span><span begin="26.227" end="26.908">ら)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">今天 看啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kyo u ho ra</span></span></p><p begin="26.916" end="31.631" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.916" end="27.651">綺</span><span begin="27.651" end="28.033">麗</span><span begin="28.033" end="28.384">だ</span><span begin="28.384" end="31.631">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">绚丽夺目</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki re i da yo</span></p><p begin="32.731" end="36.610" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.731" end="33.030">当</span><span begin="33.030" end="33.581">た</span><span begin="33.581" end="33.813">り</span><span begin="33.813" end="34.486">前</span><span begin="34.486" end="34.848">の</span><span begin="34.848" end="35.614">よ</span><span begin="35.614" end="35.962">う</span><span begin="35.962" end="36.610">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那些稀松平常的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a ta ri ma e no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="36.986" end="40.892" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="36.986" end="37.315">一</span><span begin="37.315" end="37.641">緒</span><span begin="37.641" end="38.027">に</span><span begin="38.027" end="38.758">過</span><span begin="38.758" end="39.139">ご</span><span begin="39.139" end="39.884">し</span><span begin="39.884" end="40.226">た</span><span begin="40.226" end="40.892">日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一同度过的日子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i ssho ni su go shi ta hi</span></p><p begin="41.258" end="45.143" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.258" end="41.832">笑</span><span begin="41.832" end="42.127">っ</span><span begin="42.127" end="42.347">て</span><span begin="42.347" end="42.457">泣</span><span begin="42.457" end="42.660">い</span><span begin="42.660" end="43.003">て</span><span begin="43.003" end="43.397">ふ</span><span begin="43.397" end="44.132">ざ</span><span begin="44.132" end="44.498">け</span><span begin="44.498" end="45.143">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">喜怒哀乐 酸甜苦辣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wa ra tte na i te fu za ke te</span></p><p begin="45.532" end="49.367" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="45.532" end="46.629">賑</span><span begin="46.629" end="46.775">わ</span><span begin="46.775" end="46.967">う</span><span begin="46.967" end="47.306">ア</span><span begin="47.306" end="47.688">ル</span><span begin="47.688" end="48.759">バ</span><span begin="48.759" end="49.367">ム</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">汇进了充满回忆的相册</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ni gi wa u a ru ba mu</span></p><p begin="49.428" end="57.596" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.428" end="49.796">ひ</span><span begin="49.796" end="50.346">ら</span><span begin="50.346" end="50.474">く</span><span begin="50.474" end="50.862">た</span><span begin="50.862" end="51.744">び</span><span begin="51.744" end="51.901">増</span><span begin="51.901" end="53.011">え</span><span begin="53.011" end="53.700">た</span><span begin="53.700" end="54.801">大</span><span begin="54.801" end="55.166">事</span><span begin="55.166" end="55.867">な</span><span begin="55.867" end="56.250">も</span><span begin="56.250" end="57.596">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">每一次翻开 回忆便愈发珍重</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hi ra ku ta bi fu e ta da i ji na mo no</span></p><p begin="58.006" end="1:10.860" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="58.006" end="59.086">今</span><span begin="59.086" end="59.439">で</span><span begin="59.439" end="1:00.193">も</span><span begin="1:00.193" end="1:01.241">懐</span><span begin="1:01.241" end="1:01.572">か</span><span begin="1:01.572" end="1:01.751">し</span><span begin="1:01.751" end="1:02.296">い</span><span begin="1:02.296" end="1:02.642">気</span><span begin="1:02.642" end="1:03.331">持</span><span begin="1:03.331" end="1:03.734">ち</span><span begin="1:03.734" end="1:04.449">を</span><span begin="1:04.449" end="1:05.343">思</span><span begin="1:05.343" end="1:05.494">い</span><span begin="1:05.494" end="1:05.875">出</span><span begin="1:05.875" end="1:06.576">せ</span><span begin="1:06.576" end="1:06.920">る</span><span begin="1:06.920" end="1:10.860">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">时至今日仍会对这份怀恋产生共鸣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i ma de mo na tsu ka shi i ki mo chi o o mo i da se ru yo</span></p><p begin="1:10.851" end="1:14.965" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.851" end="1:10.920">「</span><span begin="1:10.920" end="1:11.217">あ</span><span begin="1:11.217" end="1:11.786">り</span><span begin="1:11.786" end="1:11.973">が</span><span begin="1:11.973" end="1:12.127">と</span><span begin="1:12.127" end="1:12.335">う」</span><span begin="1:12.335" end="1:13.027">が</span><span begin="1:13.027" end="1:13.923">溢</span><span begin="1:13.923" end="1:14.103">れ</span><span begin="1:14.103" end="1:14.267">て</span><span begin="1:14.267" end="1:14.458">く</span><span begin="1:14.458" end="1:14.965">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">感谢之情洋溢而出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a ri ga to u ga a fu re te ku ne</span></p><p begin="1:15.152" end="1:19.209" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.152" end="1:15.873">君</span><span begin="1:15.873" end="1:16.031">が</span><span begin="1:16.031" end="1:16.238">い</span><span begin="1:16.238" end="1:16.590">て</span><span begin="1:16.590" end="1:16.941">く</span><span begin="1:16.941" end="1:17.326">れ</span><span begin="1:17.326" end="1:17.710">て</span><span begin="1:17.710" end="1:18.041">よ</span><span begin="1:18.041" end="1:18.562">か</span><span begin="1:18.562" end="1:18.747">っ</span><span begin="1:18.747" end="1:19.209">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">能够与你相伴真是太好了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki mi ga i te ku re te yo ka tta</span></p><p begin="1:19.441" end="1:23.351" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.441" end="1:20.307">胸</span><span begin="1:20.307" end="1:20.492">に</span><span begin="1:20.492" end="1:20.683">や</span><span begin="1:20.683" end="1:20.896">ど</span><span begin="1:20.896" end="1:21.633">る</span><span begin="1:21.633" end="1:21.970">あ</span><span begin="1:21.970" end="1:22.478">た</span><span begin="1:22.478" end="1:22.661">た</span><span begin="1:22.661" end="1:22.842">か</span><span begin="1:22.842" end="1:23.039">さ</span><span begin="1:23.039" end="1:23.351">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">栖居在胸口的那份温暖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mu ne ni ya do ru a ta ta ka sa wa</span></p><p begin="1:23.538" end="1:27.823" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.538" end="1:23.883">未</span><span begin="1:23.883" end="1:24.078">来</span><span begin="1:24.078" end="1:27.823">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mi ra i ga</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:24.838" end="1:27.668"><span begin="1:24.838" end="1:25.536">(始</span><span begin="1:25.536" end="1:25.914">ま</span><span begin="1:25.914" end="1:26.240">る</span><span begin="1:26.240" end="1:26.560">サ</span><span begin="1:26.560" end="1:27.105">イ</span><span begin="1:27.105" end="1:27.309">ン</span><span begin="1:27.309" end="1:27.668">ね)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">渐近的信号呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ha ji ma ru sa i n ne</span></span></p><p begin="1:27.996" end="1:32.089" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.996" end="1:28.092">「</span><span begin="1:28.092" end="1:28.400">あ</span><span begin="1:28.400" end="1:28.985">り</span><span begin="1:28.985" end="1:29.115">が</span><span begin="1:29.115" end="1:29.279">と</span><span begin="1:29.279" end="1:29.443">う」</span><span begin="1:29.443" end="1:30.148">の</span><span begin="1:30.148" end="1:31.017">花</span><span begin="1:31.017" end="1:31.195">咲</span><span begin="1:31.195" end="1:31.385">く</span><span begin="1:31.385" end="1:31.583">た</span><span begin="1:31.583" end="1:32.089">び</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">每当感谢之花绽放之时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a ri ga to u no ha na sa ku ta bi</span></p><p begin="1:32.287" end="1:36.337" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.287" end="1:33.369">輝</span><span begin="1:33.369" end="1:33.717">い</span><span begin="1:33.717" end="1:34.041">て</span><span begin="1:34.041" end="1:34.413">ゆ</span><span begin="1:34.413" end="1:34.560">く</span><span begin="1:34.560" end="1:36.337">物語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们的故事便愈发熠熠生辉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ka ga ya i te yu ku su to-ri</span></p><p begin="1:36.588" end="1:40.488" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.588" end="1:37.102">迷</span><span begin="1:37.102" end="1:37.484">う</span><span begin="1:37.484" end="1:37.661">こ</span><span begin="1:37.661" end="1:37.809">と</span><span begin="1:37.809" end="1:38.017">な</span><span begin="1:38.017" end="1:38.723">く</span><span begin="1:38.723" end="1:39.651">進</span><span begin="1:39.651" end="1:39.788">め</span><span begin="1:39.788" end="1:39.932">ば</span><span begin="1:39.932" end="1:40.136">い</span><span begin="1:40.136" end="1:40.488">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不必犹豫 勇毅前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ma yo u ko to na ku su su me ba i i</span></p><p begin="1:40.716" end="1:44.061" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.716" end="1:40.872">素</span><span begin="1:40.872" end="1:41.051">晴</span><span begin="1:41.051" end="1:41.218">ら</span><span begin="1:41.218" end="1:41.396">し</span><span begin="1:41.396" end="1:44.061">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">引人入胜般的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">su ba ra shi i</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:41.940" end="1:43.904"><span begin="1:41.940" end="1:43.011">(今日</span> <span begin="1:43.011" end="1:43.375">ほ</span><span begin="1:43.375" end="1:43.904">ら)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">今天 看啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kyo u ho ra</span></span></p><p begin="1:44.130" end="1:48.723" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.130" end="1:44.793">綺</span><span begin="1:44.793" end="1:45.169">麗</span><span begin="1:45.169" end="1:45.545">だ</span><span begin="1:45.545" end="1:48.723">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">绚丽夺目</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki re i da yo</span></p><p begin="1:50.467" end="1:58.378" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.467" end="1:50.819">と</span><span begin="1:50.819" end="1:51.569">き</span><span begin="1:51.569" end="1:51.926">に</span><span begin="1:51.926" end="1:53.655">は</span><span begin="1:53.655" end="1:54.275">ケ</span><span begin="1:54.275" end="1:54.798">ン</span><span begin="1:54.798" end="1:55.127">カ</span><span begin="1:55.127" end="1:55.869">も</span><span begin="1:55.869" end="1:56.237">し</span><span begin="1:56.237" end="1:57.108">た</span><span begin="1:57.108" end="1:57.328">っ</span><span begin="1:57.328" end="1:58.378">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有时也会吵架拌嘴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to ki ni wa ke n ka mo shi ta kke</span></p><p begin="1:59.066" end="2:06.228" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:59.066" end="1:59.429">ゴ</span><span begin="1:59.429" end="1:59.857">メ</span><span begin="1:59.857" end="2:00.113">ン</span><span begin="2:00.113" end="2:00.494">ネ</span><span begin="2:00.494" end="2:02.266">が</span><span begin="2:02.266" end="2:02.645">言</span><span begin="2:02.645" end="2:03.715">え</span><span begin="2:03.715" end="2:04.410">な</span><span begin="2:04.410" end="2:04.838">く</span><span begin="2:04.838" end="2:06.228">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却说不出那句“对不起”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">go me n ne ga i e na ku te</span></p><p begin="2:06.939" end="2:10.865" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.939" end="2:07.263">意</span><span begin="2:07.263" end="2:07.839">地</span><span begin="2:07.839" end="2:08.021">を</span><span begin="2:08.021" end="2:08.348">張</span><span begin="2:08.348" end="2:08.693">っ</span><span begin="2:08.693" end="2:09.062">て</span><span begin="2:09.062" end="2:09.835">み</span><span begin="2:09.835" end="2:10.160">た</span><span begin="2:10.160" end="2:10.865">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">任性逞强也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i ji o ha tte mi ta ri</span></p><p begin="2:11.239" end="2:15.144" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:11.239" end="2:11.940">弱</span><span begin="2:11.940" end="2:12.298">気</span><span begin="2:12.298" end="2:13.042">に</span><span begin="2:13.042" end="2:13.347">な</span><span begin="2:13.347" end="2:14.089">っ</span><span begin="2:14.089" end="2:14.438">て</span><span begin="2:14.438" end="2:15.144">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">胆怯懦弱也罢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yo wa ki ni na tte mo</span></p><p begin="2:15.516" end="2:19.424" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.516" end="2:15.836">気</span><span begin="2:15.836" end="2:16.385">付</span><span begin="2:16.385" end="2:16.567">け</span><span begin="2:16.567" end="2:16.921">ば</span><span begin="2:16.921" end="2:17.681">元</span><span begin="2:17.681" end="2:18.352">通</span><span begin="2:18.352" end="2:18.734">り</span><span begin="2:18.734" end="2:19.424">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">回过神来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki zu ke ba mo to do o ri no</span></p><p begin="2:19.845" end="2:23.215" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:19.845" end="2:20.537">カ</span><span begin="2:20.537" end="2:20.863">タ</span><span begin="2:20.863" end="2:21.169">チ</span><span begin="2:21.169" end="2:21.551">だ</span><span begin="2:21.551" end="2:23.215">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">仍是原本的模样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ka ta chi da ne</span></p><p begin="2:23.726" end="2:27.829" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.726" end="2:24.630">本</span><span begin="2:24.630" end="2:24.789">当</span><span begin="2:24.789" end="2:24.974">は</span><span begin="2:24.974" end="2:25.165">ま</span><span begin="2:25.165" end="2:25.900">だ</span><span begin="2:25.900" end="2:26.742">寂</span><span begin="2:26.742" end="2:26.954">し</span><span begin="2:26.954" end="2:26.985">い</span><span begin="2:26.985" end="2:27.105">ん</span><span begin="2:27.105" end="2:27.302">だ</span><span begin="2:27.302" end="2:27.829">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">其实我仍会孤单寂寞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ho n to u wa ma da sa bi shi i n da yo</span></p><p begin="2:28.002" end="2:32.079" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.002" end="2:28.746">君</span><span begin="2:28.746" end="2:29.085">が</span><span begin="2:29.085" end="2:29.430">遠</span><span begin="2:29.430" end="2:29.773">く</span><span begin="2:29.773" end="2:30.180">な</span><span begin="2:30.180" end="2:30.539">る</span><span begin="2:30.539" end="2:30.897">気</span><span begin="2:30.897" end="2:31.413">が</span><span begin="2:31.413" end="2:31.611">し</span><span begin="2:31.611" end="2:32.079">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">感到你离我渐行渐远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki mi ga to o ku na ru ki ga shi te</span></p><p begin="2:32.325" end="2:36.253" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.325" end="2:33.197">嬉</span><span begin="2:33.197" end="2:33.365">し</span><span begin="2:33.365" end="2:33.558">い</span><span begin="2:33.558" end="2:33.726">の</span><span begin="2:33.726" end="2:34.462">に</span><span begin="2:34.462" end="2:34.825">泣</span><span begin="2:34.825" end="2:35.316">け</span><span begin="2:35.316" end="2:35.507">て</span><span begin="2:35.507" end="2:35.723">き</span><span begin="2:35.723" end="2:35.797">ち</span><span begin="2:35.797" end="2:35.899">ゃ</span><span begin="2:35.899" end="2:36.253">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">明明喜形于色 却又泣不成声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">u re shi i no ni na ke te ki cha u</span></p><p begin="2:36.461" end="2:40.646" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.461" end="2:36.637">似</span><span begin="2:36.637" end="2:36.789">て</span><span begin="2:36.789" end="2:36.961">る</span><span begin="2:36.961" end="2:40.646">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">真相像呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ni te ru ne</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:37.634" end="2:40.856"><span begin="2:37.634" end="2:38.012">(は</span><span begin="2:38.012" end="2:38.362">つ</span><span begin="2:38.362" end="2:38.492">こ</span><span begin="2:38.492" end="2:38.731">い</span><span begin="2:38.731" end="2:39.069">の</span><span begin="2:39.069" end="2:39.976">切</span><span begin="2:39.976" end="2:40.168">な</span><span begin="2:40.168" end="2:40.856">さ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">初恋的那份酸楚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ha tsu ko i no se tsu na sa</span></span></p><p begin="2:40.829" end="2:44.905" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.829" end="2:40.881">「</span><span begin="2:40.881" end="2:41.212">あ</span><span begin="2:41.212" end="2:41.769">り</span><span begin="2:41.769" end="2:41.962">が</span><span begin="2:41.962" end="2:42.120">と</span><span begin="2:42.120" end="2:42.297">う」</span><span begin="2:42.297" end="2:43.034">を</span><span begin="2:43.034" end="2:43.886">誓</span><span begin="2:43.886" end="2:44.045">い</span><span begin="2:44.045" end="2:44.258">に</span><span begin="2:44.258" end="2:44.457">し</span><span begin="2:44.457" end="2:44.905">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">以感谢之情为誓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a ri ga to u o chi ka i ni shi te</span></p><p begin="2:45.192" end="2:49.228" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45.192" end="2:45.873">大</span><span begin="2:45.873" end="2:46.257">き</span><span begin="2:46.257" end="2:46.600">な</span><span begin="2:46.600" end="2:47.321">愛</span><span begin="2:47.321" end="2:47.639">を</span><span begin="2:47.639" end="2:48.747">育</span><span begin="2:48.747" end="2:48.905">も</span><span begin="2:48.905" end="2:49.228">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让我们心心相印 长相厮守</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">o o ki na a i o ha gu ku mo u</span></p><p begin="2:49.442" end="2:53.440" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:49.442" end="2:49.622">そ</span><span begin="2:49.622" end="2:49.808">う</span><span begin="2:49.808" end="2:50.534">彼</span><span begin="2:50.534" end="2:50.718">と</span><span begin="2:50.718" end="2:50.906">な</span><span begin="2:50.906" end="2:51.605">ら</span><span begin="2:51.605" end="2:51.947">大</span><span begin="2:51.947" end="2:52.643">丈</span><span begin="2:52.643" end="2:52.841">夫</span><span begin="2:52.841" end="2:53.036">だ</span><span begin="2:53.036" end="2:53.440">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只要和他在一起 便能安心落意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so u ka re to na ra da i jo u bu da ne</span></p><p begin="2:53.579" end="2:56.892" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.579" end="2:53.910">誇</span><span begin="2:53.910" end="2:54.078">ら</span><span begin="2:54.078" end="2:54.255">し</span><span begin="2:54.255" end="2:56.892">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">意气风发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ho ko ra shi i</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:54.805" end="2:56.770"><span begin="2:54.805" end="2:55.902">(今日</span> <span begin="2:55.902" end="2:56.210">ほ</span><span begin="2:56.210" end="2:56.770">ら)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">今天 看啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kyo u ho ra</span></span></p><p begin="2:56.953" end="3:01.008" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.953" end="2:57.114">な</span><span begin="2:57.114" end="2:57.304">ん</span><span begin="2:57.304" end="2:57.634">て</span><span begin="2:57.634" end="2:58.017">い</span><span begin="2:58.017" end="2:58.373">い</span><span begin="2:58.373" end="3:01.008">日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">多么美好的一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na n te i i hi</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:59.103" end="3:01.016"><span begin="2:59.103" end="2:59.249">(ず</span><span begin="2:59.249" end="2:59.440">っ</span><span begin="2:59.440" end="3:00.146">と</span> <span begin="3:00.146" end="3:00.332">ず</span><span begin="3:00.332" end="3:00.512">っ</span><span begin="3:00.512" end="3:01.016">と)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一直 一直</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zu tto zu tto</span></span></p><p begin="3:01.234" end="3:06.990" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.234" end="3:01.588">こ</span><span begin="3:01.588" end="3:02.332">れ</span><span begin="3:02.332" end="3:02.661">か</span><span begin="3:02.661" end="3:03.410">ら</span><span begin="3:03.410" end="3:06.555">も</span><span begin="3:06.990" end="3:06.990">…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">直至永远……</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ko re ka ra mo</span></p></div></body></tt>